	(text "Sheet-1 and sheet-3 interface pins to the FPGA are intentionally unconnected at this level until\nsheet 2 (FPGA) is drawn; LD0-LD15 join sheet 1 (U103 A port) and sheet 3 (U301). ERC reports for the\nopen pins are expected and listed in docs/stage2/sheet3-erc-report.md."
